  "plain_language": "Every measure of what a reader takes on, in every version of this project, has scored how much of the maker's PURPOSE it got. Depth is built so the purpose is equally readable however deep the work is, so that measure could not move with depth whatever was true. This scores what the reader got of the maker's METHOD, which the reader has been quietly tracking all along and nobody ever read out.",
