    "why_not_accuracy": "at mu = 1 the sub-goal posterior never leaves its uniform prior, so its argmax is a tie broken to index zero, while the true mode is autocorrelated because the chain dwells. Accuracy then measures how often the artifact happened to sit in mode zero and came out BELOW nominal chance, which no amount of information could produce. The information measure is exactly zero on an unmoved posterior whatever the truth was. Declared rather than quietly substituted.",
